    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "PHASE 2 (write mode): on a dedicated branch (never touches main),\nallowedTools now includes Edit/Write/Bash(git:*)/Bash(gh pr create:*).\nIf the approved fix turns out empty/inapplicable, it ABORTS and reports\nrather than improvising — verified live in testing.",
